            "review_title": "Review at PaPis pasta pizza steak House",
            "review_text": "TasteByRic\nDa Nang, Vietnam73 contributions\n0\nCan be better\nMar 2025 • Family\nWe’ve visited Pastapizzasteak twice. The overall service is consistently good, and the cocktails are well made. On our first visit, the food was truly outstanding excellent quality for the price, and we were very impressed.\n\nHowever, on our second visit, while the service remained friendly, the experience with the pizza was disappointing. The pizza we ordered was undercooked, still raw in the center. We sent it back to the kitchen, but after 5 minutes, they brought back the same pizza, and it was still raw. At that point, we didn’t want to continue raising the issue.\n\nTo ensure this doesn’t happen again, I believe the kitchen team needs additional training particularly on how to handle food complaints professionally and how to properly resolve the issue, whether that means re-baking or making a fresh pizza if needed.\n\nWe hope to see improvements because the restaurant has great potential.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nDefinitely try the pasta, steak, and cocktails, they are usually well done. The location is great, and the atmosphere suits both casual me.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 15, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
