            "review_text": "Ed G\n31 contributions\n0\nHow things can deteriorate!\nMay 2025 • Couples\nI had previously eaten and left a good review. But how things change in 4 months. I went there with my partner to enjoy a meal together. Her food arrived, we waited then mine came and it was a pepperoni pizza no olives. But it came with olives. I had specifically ordered no olives. Can't stand them, the pizza goes back to the kitchen and comes back with olives picked off and no apologies at all. I explain about no olives, so they get me a new pizza. I ate it as I was hungry but the dough was not fully cooked. Leaving my partner's empty dishes at the side of the table when she had shown she was finished, not good service.\n\nYour restaurant went from 5 star to 1 star.\nRead more\nWritten May 12, 2025",
